{
  "id": "pokemon-card-game-legend-launch-tournament",
  "name": "Pokémon Card Game LEGEND launch tournament",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The tournaments held in October 2009 to launch HeartGold Collection and SoulSilver Collection, the first expansions of the new Pokémon Card Game LEGEND series, released on 9 October 2009. Gym Challenge (ジム☆チャレンジ) shops of the official Pokémon Card Gym network held them in two leagues, one for elementary school children and younger and an open one, and gave every player Sentret 022/L-P with one of eight holo basic Energy cards, 011 to 018/L-P; their top finishers got Copycat 024/L-P.\n\nPokémon Challenge Hiroba (ポケモンチャレンジひろば) events held launch battles too, where every player also got Sentret and the excellence prize was Professor Elm's Training Method 023/L-P. Each of the three carries the LEGEND logo and that of HeartGold Collection or SoulSilver Collection on its picture.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "pokemon-card.com (archived): 新シリーズ「ポケモンカードゲームLEGEND」発売にあわせて、10月の「ジム☆チャレンジ」で発売記念大会を開催！",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20091012081826/http://www.pokemon-card.com:80/info/entry/091009_804.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "pokemon-card.com (archived): 新シリーズ「ポケモンカードゲームLEGEND」発売を記念した10月の「ポケモンチャレンジひろば」で、豪華賞品をゲット！",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20091012131739/http://www.pokemon-card.com:80/info/entry/091009_806.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: Japan Official Pokemon Card Gym Events 2008 – 2009",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/japan-official-pokemon-card-gym-events-2008-2009/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokeboon: 022/L-P オタチ： 「ポケモンカードゲームLEGEND」発売記念大会 参加賞",
        "url": "https://pokeboon.com/jp/022lp-sentret-promo/"
      }
    ]
  },
